language 0.1.0
module traceability
  means
    The correspondence between labelled statements and the places carrying
    them out, established in both directions, together with what is found
    missing on either side.

entity label : thing
  means
    label: a stable name by which a statement is addressed from outside the
    document declaring it.

entity mention : thing
  means
    mention: an occurrence of a label outside the document declaring it,
    naming the place that occurrence stands in.

entity trace-link : thing
  means
    trace link: the established correspondence between a labelled statement
    and a place carrying it out.

entity coverage : thing
  means
    coverage: the share of labelled statements having at least one link.

entity orphan : thing
  means
    orphan: a mention of a label that no statement declares.

entity gap : thing
  means
    gap: a labelled statement to which no mention corresponds.
